{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TMAi6iFPU5Za2P3ixkU8A3","type":"tool_result","content":"91:# PLAN-045 Wave 1 F-01-05 — chain-length canary sidecar.\n98:CHAIN_LENGTH_FILENAME = \"audit-log.chain-length\"\n169:    (key, last-hmac, chain-length) co-locate with the audit log + its\n179:    process resolved its FileLock under LOG_DIR but its chain-length counter\n209:                    # chain-length sob LOG_DIR, e ignora-los reiniciaria a\n219:                    # chain-length continuam sob LOG_DIR e o append\n271:def chain_length_path() -> Path:\n272:    \"\"\"Return the chain-length canary sidecar path.\n543:    PLAN-045 Wave 1 F-01-05 extension: also clears the chain-length\n545:    new log starts at genesis + chain-length 0. Historical archive\n553:    for p in (last_hmac_path(), chain_length_path()):\n567:# `audit_emit._write_event` now calls `write_chain_length(n+1)` under\n572:#   - `read_chain_length()` returns the persisted counter\n575:#     reason=\"chain_length_truncation\"\n596:def read_chain_length() -> int:\n597:    \"\"\"Return the persisted chain-length counter, or 0 if absent/malformed.\n606:    p = chain_length_path()\n624:def write_chain_length(n: int) -> None:\n625:    \"\"\"Persist the chain-length counter (atomic rename, 0600 perms).\n629:    against ``read_chain_length() + 1``.\n639:            \"chain-length must be non-negative, got {n}\".format(n=n)\n641:    p = chain_length_path()\n1206:    # PLAN-045 Wave 1 F-01-05: optional chain-length canary check.\n1214:            expected_length = read_chain_length()\n1218:                reason=\"chain_length_truncation\","}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"208d6398-50f3-4598-a736-f21d26865a99","uuid":"ac56b9c5-4027-4588-a1d3-83ee647685cc","timestamp":"2026-11-15T11:00:34.169Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"91:# PLAN-045 Wave 1 F-01-05 — chain-length canary sidecar.\n98:CHAIN_LENGTH_FILENAME = \"audit-lo